The client-address resolution this crate performs is the behaviour of the npm
`proxy-addr` package by Douglas Christopher Wilson
(https://github.com/jshttp/proxy-addr), together with the `forwarded` package
(https://github.com/jshttp/forwarded) and the `ipaddr.js` library
(https://github.com/whitequark/ipaddr.js) it is built on. All three are
distributed under the MIT License. This crate is an independent
reimplementation for Rust and shares no code with them.

